<html><body><div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Georgia,serif"><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><h1>The Repair Letter</h1><p>This month we visited three workshops that repair what they sell.</p><p>Each of them keeps spare parts for ten years, and each of them told us the same thing.</p><blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #cc3333;padding-left:12px;font-style:italic"><p>We fix what we sell, and we sell what we can fix.</p></blockquote></td></tr></table><p style="font-size:11px;color:#888888">Example Repairs Ltd · 1 Sample Street · Exampletown<br><a href="https://example.com/unsubscribe">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></body></html>
